---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import PageFooter from '../components/PageFooter.astro';
import SectionRule from '../components/SectionRule.astro';
import Ornament from '../components/Ornament.astro';
import Tailpiece from '../components/Tailpiece.astro';

// Deliberately holds no figures and no statuses. Results move with the data;
// they live in the papers and in the server's evidence ledger, which is
// versioned with the code. See EDITORIAL.md §4 before adding one here.
const ledger = 'https://github.com/cirwel/unitares/blob/master/docs/EVIDENCE_AND_LIMITS.md';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Research — CIRWEL Research"
  description="The research program behind UNITARES: the papers, the data, and how results are reported."
>
  <PageHeader currentPath="/research" />

  <main class="px-6 lg:px-12 max-w-screen-xl mx-auto">

    <section class="pt-16 pb-20 lg:pt-28 lg:pb-28 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-9">
        <p class="label text-oxblood mb-8 reveal reveal-1">The research program behind UNITARES</p>
        <h1 class="display text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl mb-10 reveal reveal-2">
          Research.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed text-stone max-w-prose reveal reveal-3">
          I study what can be read from an agent while it works, and how accountability can hold between principals who share no root of trust. The papers carry the results. The <a href={ledger}>evidence ledger</a> in the server repository carries their current status, and it changes with the data.
        </p>
        <Ornament size="floret" class="mt-14 opacity-70 reveal reveal-3" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="hairline mb-2"/>

    <section class="py-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 reveal reveal-4">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-3 mb-4 lg:mb-0"><p class="label text-oxblood">The receipts</p></div>
      <dl class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-9 grid grid-cols-12 gap-y-5 gap-x-6">
        <dt class="col-span-4 md:col-span-3 label text-stone pt-1">Program</dt>
        <dd class="col-span-8 md:col-span-9">Longitudinal runtime-state measurement for AI agents <span class="text-stone">· begun September 2025</span></dd>
        <dt class="col-span-4 md:col-span-3 label text-stone pt-1">Researcher</dt>
        <dd class="col-span-8 md:col-span-9"><span class="smcp">Kenny Wang</span><span class="text-stone"> · ORCID </span><a href="https://orcid.org/0009-0006-7544-2374" class="font-mono text-sm">0009-0006-7544-2374</a></dd>
        <dt class="col-span-4 md:col-span-3 label text-stone pt-1">Papers</dt>
        <dd class="col-span-8 md:col-span-9 leading-relaxed"><a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19647159" class="font-mono text-sm">UNITARES</a><span class="text-stone"> · </span><a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20098168" class="font-mono text-sm">Trajectory Identity</a><span class="text-stone"> · </span><a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21930092" class="font-mono text-sm">Digital Proprioception</a><span class="text-stone"> · </span><a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21930161" class="font-mono text-sm">Accountability Without a Trusted Center</a></dd>
        <dt class="col-span-4 md:col-span-3 label text-stone pt-1">Data</dt>
        <dd class="col-span-8 md:col-span-9"><a href="https://huggingface.co/hikewa" class="font-mono text-sm">datasets &amp; models</a></dd>
        <dt class="col-span-4 md:col-span-3 label text-stone pt-1">Current status</dt>
        <dd class="col-span-8 md:col-span-9"><a href={ledger} class="font-mono text-sm">EVIDENCE_AND_LIMITS.md</a><span class="text-stone"> · versioned with the code</span></dd>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <SectionRule class="mt-2 mb-20" />

    <section id="method" class="py-16 lg:py-24 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-3 mb-6 lg:mb-0"><p class="section-mark"><span class="sm-num">§&#8201;I</span><span class="sm-name">How results are reported</span></p></div>
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-9">
        <h2 class="display text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-8 leading-tight max-w-prose">Commitments that hold whichever way the data falls.</h2>
        <dl class="max-w-prose space-y-8">
          <div><dt class="display text-xl mb-2">Pre-registration with a kill criterion</dt><dd class="text-stone leading-relaxed">Bounded hypotheses get a fixed read and a written stop condition before the data is seen.</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="display text-xl mb-2">No convenient re-runs</dt><dd class="text-stone leading-relaxed">A bounded question does not get repeated until the answer improves.</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="display text-xl mb-2">Claims carry scope</dt><dd class="text-stone leading-relaxed">Operational observations, benchmark results, non-detections, and untested questions are kept separate rather than flattened into one confidence label.</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="display text-xl mb-2">Every result is kept</dt><dd class="text-stone leading-relaxed">A closed result keeps its number whichever way it came out, and a withdrawn one keeps the reason it was withdrawn.</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <SectionRule class="my-8" />

    <section id="wanted" class="py-16 lg:py-24 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-3 mb-6 lg:mb-0"><p class="section-mark"><span class="sm-num">§&#8201;II</span><span class="sm-name">Where outside work helps most</span></p></div>
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-9">
        <h2 class="display text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-8 leading-tight max-w-prose">Independent evaluation.</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone max-w-prose mb-6">The most valuable next test is independent or adversarial evaluation on data I did not generate.</p>
        <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed max-w-prose">If you work on evaluations, multi-agent systems, or runtime oversight and want to put it to the test, the code and data are open. <a href="/#contact" class="font-medium">Get in touch</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="flex justify-center pt-10 pb-4"><Tailpiece class="opacity-80" /></div>
  </main>

  <PageFooter />
</BaseLayout>
